The '''Bingonimbus 2000''' is an {{Epic}} [[Pickaxe]].

== Obtaining ==
The '''Bingonimbus 2000''' may be offered when talking to {{NPCSprite|Bingo}} or {{NPCSprite|Chuckleton}} on a [[Bingo#Bingo Modes|Special Bingo]] profile after completing a set number of goals.

