==Trivia== 
*The '''Bingonimbus 2000''' is a reference to both the {{Item|Pickonimbus 2000}} and the [[fandom:harrypotter:Nimbus 2000|Nimbus 2000]] from the [[w:Harry Potter|''Harry Potter'']] franchise.
*As it is {{Soulbound}}, the '''Bingonimbus 2000''' cannot be transferred from a {{Gamemode|Bingo}} profile to any other profile.

